# AegisOps – AI Incident Monitoring & Auto-Healing Platform

A Kubernetes-based AI infrastructure reliability platform that detects failed pods, monitors infrastructure health, and automatically performs self-healing operations.

## Features

- Real-time Kubernetes pod monitoring
- Auto-healing for failed containers
- FastAPI REST APIs
- Dockerized microservices
- Prometheus metrics
- Grafana + Loki observability
- GitHub Actions CI/CD

## Tech Stack

Python, FastAPI, Kubernetes, Docker, Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, Redis, GitHub Actions
